{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/efb24p","slideIndex":0,"text":"Current ClinSync feature, sourced from frontend/src/data/diagnosisPanels.ts, frontend/src/data/loinc.ts and LabOrdersTab in frontend/src/pages/doctor/index.tsx. The dropdown is optional and does not persist an ICD-10 diagnosis to the patient record or order. Add suggested tests adds catalogue IDs without duplicating or clearing existing choices. The doctor confirms with Create Order. The LOINC values here are displayed order-catalogue references; the current order API submits catalogue IDs, not a coded ICD-10-to-LOINC payload, and does not expand panels into individually coded observations. Each of the four shortcuts currently contains one catalogue entry. Reference image supplied by the user; recreated with editable text, workflow and native table. LOINC references: https://loinc.org/1558-6/ ; https://loinc.org/58410-2/ ; https://loinc.org/3016-3/ ; https://loinc.org/24331-1/ ."}